## 2. Dual-licensing options

The Licensed Software is available under either:

1. this Research License, solely for Qualified Non-Commercial Research Use; or
2. a separate commercial license executed in writing by Licensor.

No GNU General Public License or other open-source license is offered for the
Licensed Software distributed with this Research License. Section 11 addresses
