## 8. Compliance and termination

On Licensor's reasonable written request, a user must promptly certify whether
its use qualifies under this Research License and provide information
reasonably sufficient to verify that certification.

This Research License terminates automatically upon breach. If the breach is
capable of cure, Licensor may, in its sole discretion, reinstate the license in
writing after complete cure. Upon termination, the user must immediately stop
using the Licensed Software and delete all copies and modifications, except for
archival copies required by law and inaccessible for further use.

Unauthorized use may cause irreparable harm for which monetary damages are
inadequate. Licensor may seek injunctive or other equitable relief in addition
to any other available remedy.

